      "locators": "sec2.1–sec2.4, original paragraphs and tables",
      "assessment": "YihS SQ/SF/SR interconversion and beta-substrate preference; slow alpha turnover not excluded. SF anomeric product unresolved. EcYihV activity/conditions and nucleotide-associated crystallographic Mg support. Prepared EcYihT lacked activity in 2021 while SeYihT was active; 2014 coupled Ec assays remain separately cited."
    },
    {
      "source": "DOI:10.1021/acscatal.9b04427",
      "path": "/private/tmp/pathwaymech-next-201-evidence/sulfoquinovose/Sharma2020.pdf",
